{"reference":"Jeremiah 5","book":"Jeremiah","chapter":5,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"The Book Around This Chapter","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Jeremiah appears within a book that combines poetry, prose sermons, narratives, letters, headings, repeated accounts, restoration collections, oracles concerning nations, and an appendix. A common outline places chapters 2–25 together, but this outline does not settle how the book was composed.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_jeremiah_005_d39232e308ec74b0a592ab88"],"confidence":"medium","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}